Drop the stale create_business(..., p_template_id uuid) overload; remove hardcoded admin secrets; hash staff.pin to pin_hash; deduplicate dashboard_snapshots triggers.
Deploy immutable_audit_logs, fn_enforce_traceability_envelope(), deleted_at soft-delete standard, and the 4 Workforce ERP tables (staff_attendance_logs, staff_salary_advances, staff_payroll_runs, staff_payroll_slips).
